esign and Definition of Done |\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/stories/coverage.md:49:| Failed Mermaid block does not fail the whole artifact review | Story 3 | `tests/service/client/markdown-body.test.ts` | Captured in Story 3 ACs, Technical Design, and Definition of Done |\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/stories/coverage.md:53:| Mermaid render failures and unsupported-format states are readable text | Story 3 | `tests/service/client/a11y.test.ts` | Captured in Story 3 Technical Design and Definition of Done |\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/stories/coverage.md:55:| Mermaid render failures are traceable by artifact ID and version ID | Story 3 | `tests/service/server/observability.test.ts` | Captured in Story 3 Technical Design and Definition of Done |\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/stories/coverage.md:66:| Path 1.5 | Read markdown and Mermaid content in place with bounded diagram and format degradation | Story 3 | TC-3.1a, TC-3.2a, TC-3.3a, TC-3.4a | `tests/service/server/markdown-renderer.test.ts`; `tests/service/client/markdown-body.test.ts`; `tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts` |\\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/04--artifact-review-and-package-surface/stories/coverage.md:75:| Path 3.2 | Export a `.mpkz` archive whose manifest matches the reviewed package snapshot | Story 5 | TC-5.2a, TC-5.2b | `tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts`; `packages/markdown-package/tests/create-from-entries.test.ts` |\\n./tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:19:} from '../../fixtures/archive.js';\\n./tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:29:        clientId: 'client_test_archive_api',\\n./tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:30:        cookiePassword: 'story3-archive-api-cookie-password-12345',\\n./tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:45:  userId: 'workos-user-archive-1',\\n./tests/service/server/archi