\\"storyId\\\":\\\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\\\"},\\\"mode\\\":\\\"initial\\\",\\\"story\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Story 3: Archive Read and Reopen Surface\\\"},\\\"artifactsRead\\\":[\\\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\",\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\",\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/archive.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/state.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/schemas/archive.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/routes/archive.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-read.service.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-access.service.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/server/app.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/process-work-surface-api.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/app/router.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/app/shell-app.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/app/store.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-section.ts\\\",\\\"apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-archive-page.ts\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\",\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\",\\\"convex/schema.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts\\\",\\\"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\\\"],\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\":\\\"Reviewed Story 3 against the story, tech design, and test plan, then inspected the Fastify archive route/schema, archive read service, Convex archive read path, client archive bootstrap/rendering, and the mapped Story 3 tests plus the configured story gate.\\\",\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\":[],\\\"newFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"story3-bounded-page-production-read\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The real Convex archive read path still loads the full archive before paginating\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Story 3 scope requires 'one bounded archive page' (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:24-29`) and Flow 3 says `ArchiveReadService` fetches one bounded page from Convex (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:604-608`). The production query behind that path does not stay bounded: `convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` calls `.collect()` on every matching `archiveEntries` row and only slices afterward in `paginateArchiveEntries`. Small-fixture tests still pass (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:407-435`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"Scope: one bounded archive page\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"quick-fix\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"openFindings\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"story3-bounded-page-production-read\\\",\\\"severity\\\":\\\"major\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The real Convex archive read path still loads the full archive before paginating\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Story 3 scope requires 'one bounded archive page' (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface.md:24-29`) and Flow 3 says `ArchiveReadService` fetches one bounded page from Convex (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:604-608`). The production query behind that path does not stay bounded: `convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` calls `.collect()` on every matching `archiveEntries` row and only slices afterward in `paginateArchiveEntries`. Small-fixture tests still pass (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:407-435`, `tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:123-282`), but long-lived processes will force a full archive read on every request, which breaks the intended bounded production read behavior.\\\",\\\"affectedFiles\\\":[\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\"],\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"Scope: one bounded archive page\\\"],\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"quick-fix\\\",\\\"blocking\\\":true}],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"AC-3.1\\\",\\\"AC-3.2\\\",\\\"AC-3.3\\\",\\\"AC-3.4\\\",\\\"TC-3.1a\\\",\\\"TC-3.1b\\\",\\\"TC-3.2a\\\",\\\"TC-3.2b\\\",\\\"TC-3.3a\\\",\\\"TC-3.3b\\\",\\\"TC-3.4a\\\",\\\"Non-TC: INVALID_ARCHIVE_REQUEST\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[\\\"Scope: one bounded archive page\\\"]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"not-run\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-154` uses `.collect()` across the full process archive before pagination, so the real production read path is not actually bounded even though the API contract is.\\\"],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"revise\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"quick-fix\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder branch was found in the archive Fastify/client runtime surface; the blocker is in the real Convex read path.\\\",\\\"The Story 3 route/UI tests and `green-verify` gate pass because they exercise small fixtures and the in-memory store, so they do not expose the unbounded Convex query behavior.\\\"]},\\\"errors\\\":[],\\\"warnings\\\":[],\\\"artifacts\\\":[{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"result-envelope\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/ar