d view reports degraded status` | Client renders degraded view |\\\\\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/streams/014-verify.stdout.log:41:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"item_21\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"agent_message\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"artifactsRead\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolved\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"newFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"S1-F3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"major\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"affectedFiles\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementIds\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"blocking\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":true}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"requirementCoverage\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"verified\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"unverified\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.1c\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.2b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.3\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.3b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AC-1.4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"TC-1.4b\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"gatesRun\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"not-run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"productionPathFindings\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides the real Story 1 runtime path for archive entry append/read; only schema validators remain, so the production primitive itself is missing.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"revise\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"same-session-implementor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"openQuestions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"additionalObservations\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The earlier human-ruling blocker is closed: the story, tech design, and test plan now consistently scope Story 1 to primitive append/read behavior only.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder execution branch was found in the current runtime surface; the blocking issue is that the runtime primitive exports are absent, not that a fake path replaced them.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/003-story-orchestrate-run.json:1:{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"story-orchestrate run\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"version\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-user-decision\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"case\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyRunId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"currentSnapshotPath\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-current.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"eventHistoryPath\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"finalPackagePath\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/001-final-package.json\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"finalPackage\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"outcome\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"needs-ruling\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyRunId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyId\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"attempt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"storyTitle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"implementedScope\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Implemented the Story 1 Convex archive append/read primitive, including per-process sequence assignment, process-scoped finalization-key idempotency, stable ascending reads by sequence, related-context id round-tripping, and persistence-focused coverage for the canonical archive entry contract.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"acceptanceRationale\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Story-lead is pausing for caller ruling 01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001-ruling-012 before impl-lead can accept the story.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"evidence\\